# Iso cutaway: at the south wall (between the camera and the cycle) only the low strip is drawn.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
wait 1.4
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
press c 13
press right
press right
wait 13
shot cutaway_south
